  "sourceTitle": "Grapefruit Vinaigrette",
  "sourceText": "Grapefruit Vinaigrette\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 26, 2009 - 11:40pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/4 cup Fresh grapefruit juice\n1/4 cup Walnut oil\n2 teaspoons Dijon mustard\n1 teaspoon Minced garlic\nSalt to taste\nFreshly-ground black pepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 To make the vinaigrette, place all the ingredients in a jar. Cover and shake well. (You should have about 1/2 cup vinaigrette.) Refrigerate until needed.",
